description	"Chiss Ascendancy Officer

Precision tactical infantry. Allies of the empire.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% faster RoF
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
- Vibroknife (Cyan Style Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect

^5Powers:
- Deduction (Sense 1)

^6Inventory:
- Electrobinoculars

^8Attributes:
- Ysalamiri (Force Block 3)
- Rally
- Tactical Acumen (Ally Stat Viewer)
- Getup (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Assemble (1)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS2]"